# N+1 SQL Prevention

When loading related data in loops, use batch loading:

```go
// BAD — N+1
for _, conv := range conversations {
    db.Where("conversation_id = ?", conv.ID).Find(&messages)
}

// GOOD — Preload
db.Preload("Messages").Find(&conversations)

// GOOD — single query with Joins
db.Joins("JOIN messages ON ...").Find(&results)
```

Rules:
- Repository layer owns query shape
- List endpoints must document Preload strategy in tests
- Run `make ai-n-plus-one` before completing DB work
